      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Evaluate the polynomial $-2{x}^{3}-3$ at $x=2.$",
      "worked_solution": "To evaluate, we substitute $x=2$ into the polynomial and simplify: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{x}^{3}-3 & = \\\\ -2(2)^{3}-3 & = \\\\ -2(8)-3 & = \\\\ -19\\end{aligned}\n$$",
